WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.340
- Hi, everyone, Sal Khan
here from Khan Academy.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.400
And I just want to remind everyone

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.350
that as we're going through

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:10.820
what's clearly a very difficult
time in the world generally,

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.370
but especially in education,

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:14.700
that the entire team here at Khan Academy

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.030
is dedicated to making sure that teachers,

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.850
and parents, and students feel and are

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.130
as supported as possible.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.930
But I also like to remind everyone

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:26.170
that we're not-for-profit,

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:29.170
and we can only exist because
of philanthropic donations

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.800
from folks like yourself.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.010
So if you believe in a
free world class education

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.090
for anyone anywhere,

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:36.620
which I think is more relevant than ever,

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:39.550
please think about making
a donation to Khan Academy.

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:40.900
We were running at a deficit

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.830
even before the COVID crisis hit.

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:45.270
And you can imagine once the crisis hit,

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.560
our traffic has been two to three X

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:48.420
of what it typically is,

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:50.750
our registrations are
10 to 20 X of normal.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:53.780
And we're trying to accelerate
a whole series of programs,

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.240
not only supporting the server load,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.670
we've accelerated "Get Ready
for Grade Level" courses,

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:01.120
which make sure that
students around the world

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.750
have the ability to fill
in any gaps they need.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.930
So that they're optimally ready
to learn at their own time,

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:07.300
and pace, and grade level.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:10.480
We're trying to support teachers
and parents with webinars,

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.730
students with as many supports
that we can provide them.

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:16.433
But all of this is only
possible if we have donations

00:01:16.433 --> 00:01:18.120
from folks like yourself.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.030
So if you're in a position to do so,

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.880
please think about making
a donation to Khan Academy.

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:23.713
Thank you.

